{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","roleHeading":"Case","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"case"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not accessible in the current session context."}],"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit","title":"EidKit","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","type":"topic"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus/notSupported":{"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not accessible in the current session context.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"title":"PassiveAuthStatus","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassiveAuthStatus"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassiveAuthStatus"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Result of passive authentication — verifies that the data on the card was signed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Romanian state (MAI) and has not been tampered with."}]}}}